<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Bumin Qaghan</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Bumin</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Bumin Qaghan was the founder of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gokturk-khaganate">Göktürk Empire</a> and a leader of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ashina-clan">Ashina clan</a>, originally a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vassal">vassal</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rouran-khaganate">Rouran Khaganate</a>. After crushing a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/uyghurs">Uyghur</a> revolt in 546 CE, he was refused a Rouran princess in marriage and rebelled. His overthrow of the Rouran established the Gokturk Empire in the mid-sixth century.</p></div>
